.Dd 2025-09-30
.Dt EVP_MD-MD4 7ossl
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm EVP_MD-MD4
.Nd The MD4 EVP_MD implementation
.Sh DESCRIPTION
Support for computing MD4 digests through the
.Sy EVP_MD
API.
.Ss Identity
This implementation is only available with the legacy provider, and is
identified with the name "MD4".
.Ss Gettable Parameters
This implementation supports the common gettable parameters described in
.Xr EVP_MD-common 7 .
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr provider-digest 7 ,
.Xr OSSL_PROVIDER-default 7
